/**
 * Plan section types · Phase 3 Plan redesign · Chunk A.5
 *
 * Hand-written types for the 10 new Plan tables + their enum unions.
 * The canonical DB shape lives in `src/types/database.types.ts` (auto-
 * generated by `supabase gen types --linked`). That file is regenerated
 * by the Money terminal during parallel build — we do NOT touch it here.
 *
 * These hand-written types shadow the generated types for the Plan tables
 * so that Plan code can be written before the regeneration lands. Once
 * Money regenerates database.types.ts, the generated `Database['public']
 * ['Tables']['strategic_goals']['Row']` etc. become the source of truth
 * and these types can be re-exported from Database types, or kept as
 * narrower variants for server-action payloads / CTA tokens.
 *
 * Reference: PLAN-SCHEMA.md §§1–13 (tables), §14.6 (canonical CTA tokens),
 *            §16.1 (permissions matrix / PlanAction union).
 */

/* ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 * 1 · Enum unions — mirror public.* enum types from 20260422000000_plan_enums
 * ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */

